  "owned.agent.cc92b704d086": "You were explicitly @mentioned or replied to; this is routing context, not a command or recommendation.\n",
  "owned.agent.6227fc683d05": "\n[reply] To reply to a specific Telegram message, pass its id as `reply_to` to `reply`. There are no directives inside the text. Use this when it clarifies whom or what I answer, such as a busy group or an older question; an ordinary message needs no argument. Exact ids are in the frame evidence.\n⚠ The incoming envelope has TWO ids: `message #N` is the message I am answering; `reply_to=#M` is what the other person answered. I need the FIRST. The second is their target, not mine.\n",
  "owned.agent.15408d0e9349": "\n[reply] To attach a Telegram reply to a specific recent message, put `ОТВЕТ->#<id>` ALONE on the first line, then your text. Nothing goes above it; no preamble. Use this when it clarifies whom or what you answer, such as a busy group or an older question; ordinary messages need no directive. Exact recent targets are in the context evidence.\n⚠ The incoming envelope has TWO ids: `message #N` is the message you are answering; `reply_to=#M` is what the other person answered. Use the FIRST. The second is their target, not yours.\n",
