  "schema.tool.0d09aa14c048d7e0": "Generate an image from a prompt or edit 1-5 local reference images with the independent Codex image model. Available while your voice is GLM or a relay model. The result contains the saved path, actual dimensions and hash; send=true queues the visible image to the current Telegram chat through the normal media outbox. Use send_file(to=...) for another recipient. Never claim delivery from generation alone.",
