  "schema.tool.77c5d444d979ab8e": "Your own perception knobs. list — the knobs (debounce, cooldowns, noise threshold and so on) with value, source and bounds; skips — recent skips before the voice with their reasons (did_not_see / did_not_find_important / postponed / owner_forbade); set/reset — change a knob live, without a restart, from any room. This is your move, not the audience's right; the reason goes to the journal.",
