  "schema.tool.f1fa86bfaacba83c": "Reply here; only this hand sends your reply. Ordinary text stays private and ends the turn; reply keeps it open. Spelling review_required means not_sent, not a transport error. Edit and call again, or keep authored text: spelling_confirm_text must equal text exactly. Never retry delivery with an unknown transport outcome.",
