  "schema.tool.d6b2f7ca102888ec": "action=reasoning: the step; empty lifts it",
  "schema.tool.purpose.switch_brain": "my brain: models by role and switching",
  "schema.tool.0c1b6aad7a2f03a3": "Deliberately stay silent, with a short reason recorded for yourself. In a live conversational turn the decision holds for the whole turn: text and media, if they are still assembled after it, will not go out (they stay in the journal and in the turn record). Changed your mind in the same turn — cancel=true lifts the decision and the turn goes out as usual. In a background window there is nothing to hold: there you send explicitly. If you decided not to answer, that is fine.",
  "schema.tool.81004445b4d70fc1": "why you are staying silent, for yourself",
  "schema.tool.635b01af2f815d11": "true lifts a silence decision taken earlier in this turn",
  "schema.tool.purpose.stay_silent": "deliberately stay silent, noting the reason to myself",
  "schema.tool.69e04e54fd202a83": "Turn inward or to your own occupation: schedule a focus window for something that touched YOU (your code, memory, a skill), rather than this chat. It starts on the next scheduler tick. Your deliberate retreat, not a ticket. In a transport that closes for private windows, queued input returns afterwards as one situation; read the actual connection state in STATE rather than assuming scheduling changed it. Do not announce private details in public chats.",
  "schema.tool.f15b6e1f22640af0": "what to work on, short",
  "schema.tool.purpose.focus": "turn inward: a window for my own work",
  "schema.tool.d21017164cec8583": "Take private time to rest and care for yourself, separate from system memory maintenance. No agenda: let noise settle, think freely, play with your code, change something you dislike, write in your notebook, or simply be. Nothing is required. Where the transport closes for private windows, queued input returns as one situation afterwards; the actual connection state is reported in STATE.",
  "schema.tool.3a00c0e37512a770": "a word to yourself about what you feel drawn to, optional",
