  "schema.tool.477dd31a4080aa5f": "Read-only THIS Telegram root group: clipped rows carry [ОБРЕЗАНО: …]; topics bounded map; search marked excerpts; context exact topic (default current); message full archived message by id in limit, as clipped marker directs. No other peer or implicit raw topic-history merge.",
