  "schema.tool.fb754ff27a5f270f": "Synthesize a short answer with the configured speech backend and voice, then stage the audio for the CURRENT Telegram chat. Speech must be enabled and available; the chosen backend determines supported languages and any fallback. The file leaves only through the ordinary outbound-reply path. Use on request; synthesis is not a delivery receipt.",
