  "schema.tool.4fb04b834d508b06": "Find a room: by the names of your Telegram dialogs AND by your own notes about rooms (memory/rooms — title, id, your summary). It also answers with the room's mode: a frozen room has no incoming, and that is said plainly. Message text is NOT searched here — use search_private_messages for that, and read_other_chat to open one room by address. This is an internal overview: an address you found is not permission to disclose someone's private information.",
