  "schema.tool.0d2c147f7e487ace": "Explicitly search text across your own Telegram DMs when actually needed. Nothing from DMs enters ordinary context by itself. Results are internal memory; retrieving personal or cross-chat material does not authorize disclosing it to the current audience.",
