  "schema.tool.f2fc9aa2ce9de3be": "Optional exact standard input text; omitted means closed stdin",
  "schema.tool.cb0d869ee246b759": "Optional extra environment for this one program: [{{name, value}}]. The facts line and task receipts name variables only; like any tool argument, the values stay in this run's call record. PRAXIS_* is runtime-owned and refused. Nothing is read from settings.",
