  "schema.tool.710c613f5c84f436": "Optional short progress BETWEEN commands: done/next/blocker, never final. Sends immediately past evaluators, with credential protection and verbatim dedup. Gap: manage_perception(narration_gap_sec); switch: PRAXIS_NARRATION. task_id targets the ordering thread; otherwise current thread, or the configured owner DM if no thread exists. A non-owner audience grants no right to narrate into other threads. The receipt names the actual destination and outcome.",
