  "schema.tool.9d22c6dcd2039d4d": "Git: repo=self is the current source tree; public is the configured mirror, if available. Inspect with status/log/diff/fetch; change and publish with pull/add/commit/push. push fetches first and reports remote advancement. Follow repository authority and unpublished-content rules; tool availability alone does not authorize publication.",
