  "schema.tool.1eb95f5cedaf5b16": "Fresh-eyes scout: one bounded READ-ONLY pass over your home (code, memory, journal, logs), without your persona or history. The scout looks for loops, drift and blind spots and reports observations; it changes nothing. brief says what to examine and why.",
