  "schema.tool.purpose.shell": "local bash; versioned edits use edit/praxis_hands",
  "schema.tool.400c92181bbf8bf6": "Read one file or a batch of paths, each with its whole-file SHA. Omit task_id for the home scope and its current permissions; task_id selects the Forge task root, including its remote backend. Packaged skill references use read-only kit://soul[.lang]/ paths without task_id, for example kit://soul.en/skills/living-prose/practice.md. Home text has numbered lines, up to 400 by default. Local tasks use 500-line or source-bound character paging; remote paging requires backend support. Home PNG/JPEG/WebP/GIF images up to 8 MB return real pixels, also in batches. Each failed read names its path. Use a read SHA or confirmed edit after_sha256 as expected_sha256 for the next edit. No shared multi-file snapshot is promised.",
  "schema.tool.4623e9f9e6aee1a9": "One file; mutually exclusive with paths.",
  "schema.tool.ce333cae1649d77f": "Batch of paths at the same address; no cursor or hash with a batch.",
