  "schema.tool.6a7c5fef764622aa": "Close a work turn by your own decision. Until this tool is called, the turn remains open: ordinary text becomes a note and the agent is called again. done: work completed, name an observable trace and where it is visible in evidence; blocked: a concrete obstacle; wait: the awaited event and wake condition.",
