  "schema.tool.4cd2a2339188c794": "In THIS turn: prepare provides exact complete bounded sources and selection. Read them, author your own recap, then fold(selection,text). Originals and unselected tail remain. No auxiliary generation or hard-threshold bypass. list/read inspect; rewrite preserves prior text. read returns one exact page with sha256, next_start_char and eof; continue with start_char=next_start_char and expected_sha256=sha256. A version_conflict requires restarting at 0. Episodic memory only, not tool history. Legacy refold remains in the schema but refuses background authorship; use prepare/fold.",
