  "schema.tool.3b795a25fdad946d": "Choose an intention/deadline, not an obligation. wake: live turn with available connectivity; window: focused work, inspect actual connectivity in STATE rather than assuming all transports close. message: live turn at the deadline with text/target that YOU send through send_message, never automatically. note: self/owner reminder; email: mail. when: ISO, in 2h/in 30m/in 2m, today 14:00/tomorrow 10:00; recurring daily 02:00/every 4h. Keep these syntax words untranslated. target: message/email recipient. Micro-return: wake in 2m with a goal, then decide live what/whom to send or stay silent.",
