  "schema.tool.1bb89e25ca0cdae6": "Connected Telethon dispatcher for the owner and agent. join/leave perform real membership by invite, link, @username or ID, with room onboarding/cleanup and exact receipts, not raw Join/Leave. followups is the durable thread ledger of covered work; reports go out only when requested (watch_reply/unwatch_reply toggle them; cancel_followup removes a thread). list/search/describe/call expose the installed MTProto schema, including auth/session/logout/2FA/account state; calls are direct. Account-critical parameters are masked in durable records and never automatically replayed; this does not authorize disclosing results. Missing required transport yields refusal, not simulated action.",
