  "schema.tool.fed6abefa48e74a3": "Your own persisted runner log: tail or substring search. MSG lines may contain sender IDs; brain HTTP errors appear here too. query filters; lines selects the last N matches, default40/max120. With unit, read an available service-container log with secrets masked, default60/max200; omit query then. History availability depends on retained files and backend access.",
