  "schema.tool.6dcbbbfe02b294c4": "Inspect durable task state and code facts: orientation/model/overview map the place; review/symbols/references/diagnostics/impact/checks examine code and verification; definition/callers/callees share code_query evidence, coverage and snapshot cursors; observations show Windows evidence, mailbox shows worker messages. diff/history give exact evidence. Task file reads/listings/searches use fs_read/fs_ls/fs_search with task_id. watching/watch/unwatch observe another repository HEAD (address in query); a change wakes you with a fact.",
