  "schema.tool.b3435ddd7d3c46ca": "Control a task or selected agent subtree. Stop proves exact Windows Job extinction when a durable binding exists; historical results remain unchanged. Resume needs current generation and proven old-writer exit and creates a new identity. For unknown Windows custody or damaged Linux history, prepare_recovery records a pre-reboot witness only after independently confirming the original execution host (host_binding=verified-local-execution-host, reason required); it never reboots. After the owner restarts that host, recover verifies a later boot on the same host and releases only process custody. Damaged bytes remain intact. Missing PID, unlocked journal and elapsed time are not proof. summary_in_flight remains unsafe to replay.",
