  "schema.tool.36cd539a48dc8ca9": "Use the connected computer under current owner-issued permissions; available actions depend on its body and graphical session. The brain’s OS does not determine the remote body’s OS. status/inventory/list/stat read state. send exports an exact path and sends the verified file to the CURRENT chat. run/poll/stop manage launch operations: PowerShell on Windows, the native shell on other bodies. run returns operation_id without awaiting completion. run timeout_ms is the process lifetime from start, not RPC wait; Windows Body rounds UP to whole seconds. 0/omitted means no deadline. Poll the SAME operation to a final state; read timed_out/cancelled/unknown and job_note literally and verify process-tree cleanup. A lost reply or timeout does not authorize restarting the command.\ndesktop_status/windows/read_window/activate/input/screenshot/observe/clipboard_read/clipboard_write/processes are native connected-desktop actions, not Office COM. read_window is the primary view: accessibility tree with role/name/value/automation_id/rect/centres; Windows uses UI Automation, other bodies their backend. Get hwnd from windows; omission selects foreground. shape=tree|flat, text_contains and max_nodes/max_depth/max_text_chars bound reading; receipts disclose limits and unread parts. find_elements uses the same selector without acting (automation_id/role/name/name_contains/value_contains), returns matches up to element_limit and scan completeness. Not found and not fully read differ. timeout_ms here is the appearance/read wait budget, not process lifetime.\nact_element acts on a nonempty exact selector, not coordinates: element_action=invoke|set_value|toggle|expand|collapse|select|scroll_into_view|focus. It uses supported native patterns; a missing pattern is refused with available patterns, never a fallback coordinate click. Multiple matches refuse with candidates unless nth is supplied; a present but blank selector field also refuses, never widens the search. Supply your own stable idempotency_key: the same intent reuses the same key and arguments; a new intent gets a new key. ok:true means the pattern ran and element_after was read back, not that your goal was achieved. Do not repeat input because observation failed.\nPrefer type_text/hotkey/key/move/click/scroll; input accepts one ordered mixed events batch with mouse_down/mouse_up/drag. Held buttons are batch-scoped; drag requires both endpoints. After activate, controls may select all text (for example WinForms TextBox), so type_text would replace it. Place the caret by click or End before appending; Escape keeps selection, and a quick second click may select a word. scroll uses signed steps or direction=up/down/left/right; on Windows one step is a Win32 notch. Wheel targets the pointer: x/y inside the target or expected_foreground for its centre. Get hwnd before activate. Supply expected_foreground/expected_pid when the target is known so focus changes refuse.\nscreenshot captures and sends verified PNG to the current chat; observe attaches those verified pixels to the next step only for vision-capable models. Text-only models get a reference without pixels: never describe the screen from it, use read_window. observe(path=file) attaches an image from the body’s disk (PNG/JPEG/WebP/GIF up to 8MB) without chat transit.\nread/hash/write/replace are direct body file actions: read returns numbered start..end lines and sha256; write atomically writes content up to 1.5MB, larger content uses artifacts. On Windows, non-ASCII .ps1/.psm1/.psd1 receive UTF-8 BOM for PowerShell 5.1. replace changes EXACTLY ONE old; expected_sha256 is CAS for write/replace, backup=true retains the old version. Writing is owner/agent-self only, not included in an ordinary computer.files grant. Stable identity is checked on each call; desktop requires computer.apps. execution=system is sovereign-only and requires a supported route; unavailable in Python delivery with its broker disabled. Desktop normally needs interactive. For “send file X”, use send.",
