  "worker.schema.inspect_tool.tool": "See the exact task place. Besides read/search/diff, model/symbols/references/diagnostics/impact/checks expose normalized semantic and test facts; definition/callers/callees use the shared code_query evidence engine, coverage and snapshot cursor; mailbox shows worker signals. Large read replies are exact UTF-8 JSON pages (<=8000 chars): continue with start=next_start, start_char=next_char, expected_sha256=sha256; a changed file refuses the old hash. Small reads retain the legacy numbered-line display.",
